cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this framework, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Extended Cyber Kill Chain for AI-Era Threats"
abstract: >-
  A defender-side framework that extends the Lockheed Martin Cyber Kill Chain
  with one new pre-attack stage (Model Supply Chain Compromise), AI-augmented
  sub-techniques across the original seven stages, and an expanded
  Actions-on-Objectives stage covering Model Extraction and Agentic Pivot as
  first-class adversary objectives. Designed to integrate AI-era threats into
  existing kill-chain-based SOC and detection-engineering operations rather
  than maintain a parallel taxonomy.
